      <div class="alpine-sentinel" style="margin-top:3rem"><strong>Â§ 02</strong>Informational, not contractual</div>
      <h2>Pricing pages, service pages.</h2>
      <p>The information on this site is provided to help you decide if Alpine is the right inspection firm for you. Prices listed on the site are typical ranges drawn from completed work; the actual price for your inspection is what we quote you on the phone or in writing before booking, and it's binding once you book.</p>
